    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "Through the workshop How do I start a business as an artist?, Accès Microcrédit Gaspésie-Îles-de-la-Madeleine discusses the different stages related to the creation of an enterprise. From ideation to expansion, we will cover the various steps that promoters need to address when developing a business project."
      }
